# Gmail SMTP Configuration for Email OTP
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification in your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate an App Password under "App passwords": https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter your gmail and the 16-character generated app password below:
EMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your_16_character_app_password
EMAIL_SERVICE=gmail
